{"capturado_en": "2026-11-11T23:37:45+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sonic Origins", "steam_appid": 1794960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [2343200], "detailed_description": "<h1>Feature List</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Blue Blur is back with an expanded multi-game collection of classic Sonic the Hedgehog games - Sonic Origins Plus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sonic Origins features four beloved classic titles– Sonic the Hedgehog, Sonic 2, Sonic 3 &amp; Knuckles, and Sonic CD. Spin Dash your way through numerous zones in Classic mode with the game’s original resolution and limited lives, or the new Anniversary Mode with unlimited lives in revamped widescreen HD.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sonic Origins Plus include the four classic titles and bundles 12 Sonic Game Gear titles, previously released add-on content, playable Knuckles in Sonic CD, and for the first time ever, Amy Rose as a playable character in Sonic the Hedgehog 1, 2, Sonic 3 &amp; Knuckles, and Sonic CD! With more content than ever before, this is the definitive way to experience these classic games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Redefined</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 4 classic remastered Sonic titles – Sonic the Hedgehog, Sonic 2, Sonic 3 &amp; Knuckles, and Sonic CD in high-definition, with all-new opening and ending animations for each title!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794960/extras/46644f5bd815030ec0e2c3049d4b3567.poster.avif?t=1785747978\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794960/extras/46644f5bd815030ec0e2c3049d4b3567.webm?t=1785747978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794960/extras/46644f5bd815030ec0e2c3049d4b3567.mp4?t=1785747978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Gear Titles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play 12 classic Sonic Game Gear titles including:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Sonic the Hedgehog </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Sonic the Hedgehog 2</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Sonic Chaos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Dr. Robotnik's Mean Bean Machine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Sonic Drift</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Sonic Spinball</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Sonic the Hedgehog Triple Trouble</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Sonic Drift 2 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Tails' Skypatrol</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Tails Adventure </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Sonic Labyrinth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Sonic Blast<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794960/extras/9d577834dc6414d0190e79591cb27da9.poster.avif?t=1785747978\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794960/extras/9d577834dc6414d0190e79591cb27da9.webm?t=1785747978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794960/extras/9d577834dc6414d0190e79591cb27da9.mp4?t=1785747978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Playable Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Sonic, Tails, Knuckles or – for the first time ever – Amy Rose in Sonic the Hedgehog 1, 2, Sonic 3 &amp; Knuckles, and Sonic CD!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794960/extras/e2dbea55201524d388db22851384d0b1.poster.avif?t=1785747978\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794960/extras/e2dbea55201524d388db22851384d0b1.webm?t=1785747978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794960/extras/e2dbea55201524d388db22851384d0b1.mp4?t=1785747978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All-in-One Bundle &amp; New Unlockables</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sonic Origins Plus includes the Classic Music Pack and Premium Fun Pack, which contain Extreme Missions, additional screen borders, new character animations in menus, added music from other Sonic titles, and more! Unlock Mirror Mode, new stages, challenges, behind-the-scenes content, a music player, animated shorts, special stages, and more!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Blue Blur is back with an expanded multi-game collection of classic Sonic the Hedgehog games - Sonic Origins Plus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sonic Origins features four beloved classic titles– Sonic the Hedgehog, Sonic 2, Sonic 3 &amp; Knuckles, and Sonic CD. Spin Dash your way through numerous zones in Classic mode with the game’s original resolution and limited lives, or the new Anniversary Mode with unlimited lives in revamped widescreen HD.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sonic Origins Plus include the four classic titles and bundles 12 Sonic Game Gear titles, previously released add-on content, playable Knuckles in Sonic CD, and for the first time ever, Amy Rose as a playable character in Sonic the Hedgehog 1, 2, Sonic 3 &amp; Knuckles, and Sonic CD! With more content than ever before, this is the definitive way to experience these classic games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Redefined</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 4 classic remastered Sonic titles – Sonic the Hedgehog, Sonic 2, Sonic 3 &amp; Knuckles, and Sonic CD in high-definition, with all-new opening and ending animations for each title!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794960/extras/46644f5bd815030ec0e2c3049d4b3567.poster.avif?t=1785747978\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794960/extras/46644f5bd815030ec0e2c3049d4b3567.webm?t=1785747978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794960/extras/46644f5bd815030ec0e2c3049d4b3567.mp4?t=1785747978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Gear Titles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play 12 classic Sonic Game Gear titles including:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Sonic the Hedgehog </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Sonic the Hedgehog 2</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Sonic Chaos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Dr. Robotnik's Mean Bean Machine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Sonic Drift</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Sonic Spinball</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Sonic the Hedgehog Triple Trouble</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Sonic Drift 2 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Tails' Skypatrol</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Tails Adventure </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Sonic Labyrinth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Sonic Blast<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794960/extras/9d577834dc6414d0190e79591cb27da9.poster.avif?t=1785747978\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794960/extras/9d577834dc6414d0190e79591cb27da9.webm?t=1785747978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794960/extras/9d577834dc6414d0190e79591cb27da9.mp4?t=1785747978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Playable Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Sonic, Tails, Knuckles or – for the first time ever – Amy Rose in Sonic the Hedgehog 1, 2, Sonic 3 &amp; Knuckles, and Sonic CD!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794960/extras/e2dbea55201524d388db22851384d0b1.poster.avif?t=1785747978\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794960/extras/e2dbea55201524d388db22851384d0b1.webm?t=1785747978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794960/extras/e2dbea55201524d388db22851384d0b1.mp4?t=1785747978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All-in-One Bundle &amp; New Unlockables</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sonic Origins Plus includes the Classic Music Pack and Premium Fun Pack, which contain Extreme Missions, additional screen borders, new character animations in menus, added music from other Sonic titles, and more! Unlock Mirror Mode, new stages, challenges, behind-the-scenes content, a music player, animated shorts, special stages, and more!</p>", "short_description": "Experience the collected adventures of Sonic the Hedgehog in Sonic Origins Plus! With 16 legendary Sonic titles including 12 Game Gear games, new playable characters, modes, challenges, behind the scenes content, and more, this is the definitive way to play these classic games!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1794960/header.jpg?t=1785747978", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.s